      <Value><![CDATA[{
  "contentData": [
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "0708fc2f-92f1-4efc-a9d1-a755f66e6845",
      "key": "a89478af-c3c9-4bfc-b520-ff4cf3fb32e2",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "f170b29c-338f-4ab8-a5c4-f72c90826f69",
      "key": "b34d408b-156e-4bd0-82f3-2bcb498d68af",
      "values": []
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "34e5aa3b-db10-40a1-893d-79e98cd3f2f4",
      "key": "96792caa-26a2-4e1b-9c8b-ae77b6f49af0",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Features"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003E4* hotel\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EHalf board accommodation\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EAll excursion travel \u0026amp; guided tours included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEntrance fees to non-National Trust properties included\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EIncluded train excursion on Day 3\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBlue Badge guide on Days 2 to 4\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EExecutive coach throughout\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "1d09b5af-b95a-4af5-b8f2-323db029e817",
      "key": "ea068080-7b19-464c-9842-f884b1404473",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Accommodation"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWe stay four nights at the 4* Thorpe Park Hotel \u0026amp; Spa, on the outskirts of Garforth (\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.thorpeparkhotel.co.uk/\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003Ewww.thorpeparkhotel.co.uk\u003C/a\u003E). Facilities at the hotel include a restaurant, bar, indoor swimming pool, sauna, Jacuzzi and a steam room. All rooms are en suite and feature television, and tea \u0026amp; coffee making facilities. A set 3 course dinner without drinks is included in our hotel on the first night. A choice 3 course dinner without drinks is included in our hotel on the remaining three nights of our tour.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "a00f052f-2581-4b24-a04e-a49db5a87615",
      "key": "c68b60aa-e8e3-4b80-b459-eef23a09b980",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "For more information on this tour contact your Group Organiser"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EOnce you have received your Confirmation and Invoice, you can pay your final balance.\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "2d9b0603-29ef-423a-8d3e-d9c039d3d7b1",
      "key": "496bb562-9be2-4fc5-8e49-c4296cc13a85",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Sights"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cul\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EYorkshire Sculpture Park\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ECastle Howard\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBeningbrough Hall \u0026amp; Gardens\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBront\u00EB Parsonage Museum\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EKeighley \u0026amp; Worth Valley Railway steam train excursion\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EEast Riddlesden Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ELotherton Hall\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003ESalt\u2019s Mill \u0026amp; 1853 Gallery\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003Cli\u003E\u003Cp\u003EBrodsworth Hall \u0026amp; Gardens\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003C/li\u003E\n\u003C/ul\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "c4b3a613-0d2c-4470-8d06-f7efea52d6e0",
      "key": "e0b6083f-a9be-437e-acc9-de4dadef5831",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "In this page"
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyNavigationInPageItems",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": [
            "731c5122-ef13-4353-ae5f-1a58933bdd2f",
            "96792caa-26a2-4e1b-9c8b-ae77b6f49af0",
            "ea068080-7b19-464c-9842-f884b1404473",
            "496bb562-9be2-4fc5-8e49-c4296cc13a85",
            "f4153035-25e7-4da3-a303-bd9f04dce4fc",
            "3ae0981b-b66f-4005-b55f-3be90bf66435",
            "c68b60aa-e8e3-4b80-b459-eef23a09b980"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "contentTypeKey": "837beecf-4239-4b3d-b683-1d611af3da2e",
      "key": "731c5122-ef13-4353-ae5f-1a58933bdd2f",
      "values": [
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureTitle",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": "Itinerary"
        },
        {
          "alias": "richTextContent",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Ch3\u003EDay 1\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWe depart by private executive coach from our designated pick up points. En route to our hotel we visit the Yorkshire Sculpture Park, featuring a changing display of large bronze sculptures by Henry Moore. We continue to the 4* Thorpe Park Hotel \u0026amp; Spa, on the outskirts of Garforth for a four night stay on a half board basis.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 2\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOur Blue Badge guide meets us at our hotel this morning and accompanies us throughout the day. This morning we visit Castle Howard. Set in a beautiful 1,000 acre park adorned with rose gardens, lakes and fountains, this magnificent 18th century house is home to the Howard family and has been richly furnished throughout. This afternoon we visit the National Trust\u2019s Beningbrough Hall and Gardens, a grand 1716 Georgian mansion with an impressive baroque interior. The mansion is home to more than a hundred 18th century portraits and seven new interpretation galleries, designed in partnership with the National Portrait Gallery.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 3\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EOn arrival in Haworth this morning we visit the Bront\u00EB Parsonage Museum, the former home of the world\u2019s most famous literary family. We then enjoy an included one way nostalgic train journey from Haworth to Keighley on the Keighley and Worth Valley Railway, the line that featured in \u2018The Railway Children\u2019. With our Blue Badge guide this afternoon we visit the National Trust\u2019s East Riddlesden Hall, home of 17th century cloth merchant James Murgatroyd.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 4\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EWith our Blue Badge guide this morning we visit Lotherton Hall, a grand but comfortable house which is made up of late Victorian and Edwardian extensions made by Colonel Gascoigne, based around a Regency-period core. Here we bask in the ambience of this charming country home and museum, that gives a taste of the lives of the English upper classes in the early 1900s. Restored servants\u2019 rooms also explore the lives of the staff that helped run this house. Lotherton Hall is a treasure trove of internationally important 19th and 20th century decorative art, including objects from many important designers and makers. We continue to Saltaire to see the houses built by Sir Titus Salt for his workers before visiting Salt\u2019s Mill and 1853 Gallery. The 1853 Gallery takes its name from the date of the building in which it is housed and displays paintings by local born artist David Hockney.\u003C/p\u003E\n\u003Ch3\u003EDay 5\u003C/h3\u003E\n\u003Cp\u003EAfter checking out of our hotel we visit the English Heritage\u2019s Brodsworth Hall and Gardens in South Yorkshire. This fine country house has been preserved with the patina of wear, showing how a wealthy family and their servants really lived during 150 years of occupation. Taking carefully selected comfort stops en route, we return back to our original pick up points.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureDescription",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": ""
        },
        {
          "alias": "featurePropertyFeatureSummary",
          "culture": null,
          "editorAlias": null,
          "segment": null,
          "value": {
            "blocks": {
              "contentData": [],
              "settingsData": [],
              "expose": [],
              "layout": {}
            },
            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003ENB:- Please note we reserve the right to alter the above itinerary if required for operational\nreasons. Given the historic nature of the places visited, a certain degree of walking will be involved, and this holiday may not be suitable for those with mobility problems.\u003C/p\u003E\n"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
